    dct:title "`collect_audit_trail()` MUST accept optional `limit`, `offset`, `since`, and…" ;
    dct:description "`collect_audit_trail()` MUST accept optional `limit`, `offset`, `since`, and `kind` parameters for SPARQL-level pagination. Filtering is pushed to the SPARQL engine via `ORDER BY DESC(?timestamp) LIMIT/OFFSET` and `FILTER(?timestamp > ...)`. Calling with no arguments returns the full trail (backward compatible)." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom spec:source-dcc526b3 ;
